# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, so the checked-out working
# copy is stable across Windows, macOS, and Linux.
#
# The DSH profile stores every config file as LF. The apply/capture scripts
# compare SHA-256 hashes against the live profile, so a CRLF working copy would
# report a false difference on every run. Keep the working copy LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never rewrite these
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
